Project Title: AI-Enhanced Automation for Cybersecurity Reporting

Sponsor: Sarah Moore

Affiliation: OrbitalFire Cybersecurity

Email: sarah@orbitalfire.com

Project Description: Cybersecurity teams generate large volumes of raw output data from penetration tests and vulnerability scans, but transforming those results
into clear, concise, and professional customer ready reports require alot of time and manual work. In this project, our team will design, implement, and evaluate
a software application that ingests penetration testing and vulnerability scan outputs, extract key information, and converts them
into a consistent structure. The application will use AI-assisted parsing/information extraction to acquire details such as severity, evidence, affected systems, and
recommended fixes. Utilizing the structured data, the application will automatically generate professional customer ready reports aligned with OrbitalFire's branding.
We will evaluate the performance of this application using report consistency/quality, extraction accuracy, and time saved compared to a manual reporting workflow.

Required Skillset:
Strong programming experience, with Python being preferred, especially for developing automation scripts.
Interest in data engineering, automation, or AI- assisted text generation.
Ability to work with structured or unstructured data (CSV, JSON, XML, and more).
Curiosity about cybersecurity concepts.
An added bonus would be having experience utilizing templating engines such as (Jinja2, docx), APIs, or natural language processing.



